+
+Moving a member requires the `manager` role in both projects (403 otherwise). The user keeps
+their role in the destination; tasks they were assigned in the source project become unassigned.
+404 if the user is not a member of the source or the destination is missing/other-org; 409 if
+either project is archived or the user is already in the destination; 400 for a missing or
+identical destination.
 
 Statuses: `open`, `doing`, `done`. Errors are `{"error":"..."}`.
 
